---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const title = "Hi, I'm Bruce.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title}>
  <p>A web developer, ui engineer, drummer, and wannabe pilot living in the south east of England.</p>
  <p>I try my best to build web solutions that are <a href="https://resilientwebdesign.com/">resilient</a>, <a href="https://trentwalton.com/2014/03/10/device-agnostic/">usable</a> and as future-friendly as possible. For this reason I prefer a vanilla approach and tend to be fairly tech-agnostic.</p>
  <h2>What's this website about?</h2>
  <p>It's an experimental playground for web development ideas, techniques, features, demos and learnings, using the Astro web framework as the platform.</p>
  <p>Think of it as a sandbox for trying things out, rather than anything with a fixed brief.</p>
</BaseLayout>
